 * \sa Mdt::SerialPort::SettingsDialog
 *
 *
 * \section SerialPort_PortSetup Port setup
 *
 * \startuml "Port setup"
 * !include ClassDiagrams/PortSetup.puml
 * \enduml
 *
 * \sa Mdt::SerialPort::PortSetup
 *
 *
 * \section SerialPort_DeviceSpecifics Device sepcifics
 *
 * \sa \ref SerialPort_Device_MoxaUPort
 *
 *
 * \section SerialPort_PlatformSpecifics Platform sepcifics
 *
 * \todo The Engine was a first attempt for specific tasks,
 * like configure the interface of some serial port devices.
 * It is only a sandbox, and should be removed.
 *
